1
00:00:00,606 --> 00:00:03,416
(Mike M:)It's just, you were scared
and miserable the whole time.

2
00:00:04,476 --> 00:00:07,386
(Bernadette:)I think what we're all trying to say
is, you don't seem to be remembering

3
00:00:07,546 --> 00:00:09,546
(Bernadette:)how traumatic the experience
was for you.

4
00:00:09,615 --> 00:00:12,925
(Raj:)Like how women often forget
the pain of childbirth.

5
00:00:13,318 --> 00:00:15,388
(Mike R:)Like a woman. Great analogy.

6
00:00:16,989 --> 00:00:19,229
(Howard:)Fine, maybe I was a little scared.

7
00:00:19,391 --> 00:00:21,301
(Mike M:)You peed in your space suit.

8
00:00:22,294 --> 00:00:23,504
(Howard:)You're supposed to do that.

9
00:00:23,662 --> 00:00:25,642
(Mike M:)Not during the fitting.

10
00:00:27,299 --> 00:00:30,009
(Mike R:)Son, do I need to remind you
what you asked me to do

11
00:00:30,169 --> 00:00:31,809
(Mike R:)before you went up last time?

12
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:34,680
(Leonard:)Hang on.
That was just me joking around.

13
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,180
(Mike R:)You wanted me to shoot you
in the foot.

14
00:00:39,011 --> 00:00:40,351
(Howard:)Come on, how is that not a joke?

15
00:00:40,512 --> 00:00:42,512
"You got to get me out of this.
Shoot me in the foot."

16
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:47,190
(Bernadette:)Don't forget all the other
astronauts picking on you.

17
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:49,360
(Raj:)And how you threw up
in zero gravity,

18
00:00:49,521 --> 00:00:51,261
(Raj:)and it floated back in your mouth.

19
00:00:52,458 --> 00:00:55,498
(Raj:)And you threw up again.
And so on and so on.

20
00:00:57,996 --> 00:01:00,026
(Mike M:)That was funny.

